{
  "url": "https://quranenc.com/en/browse/english_saheeh/105",
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "6189",
      "sura": "105",
      "aya": "1",
      "arabic_text": "أَلَمۡ تَرَ كَيۡفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِأَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡفِيلِ",
      "translation": "Have you not considered, [O Muḥammad], how your Lord dealt with the companions of the elephant?[1992]",
      "footnotes": "[1992] i.e., the army under the command of Abrahah al-Ashram which was accompanied by a huge elephant and came with the intention of destroying the Kaʿbah at Makkah."
    },
    {
      "id": "6190",
      "sura": "105",
      "aya": "2",
      "arabic_text": "أَلَمۡ يَجۡعَلۡ كَيۡدَهُمۡ فِي تَضۡلِيلٖ",
      "translation": "Did He not make their plan into misguidance?[1993]",
      "footnotes": "[1993] Causing them to perish."
    },
    {
      "id": "6191",
      "sura": "105",
      "aya": "3",
      "arabic_text": "وَأَرۡسَلَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ طَيۡرًا أَبَابِيلَ",
      "translation": "And He sent against them birds in flocks,",
      "footnotes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6192",
      "sura": "105",
      "aya": "4",
      "arabic_text": "تَرۡمِيهِم بِحِجَارَةٖ مِّن سِجِّيلٖ",
      "translation": "Striking them with stones of hard clay,",
      "footnotes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6193",
      "sura": "105",
      "aya": "5",
      "arabic_text": "فَجَعَلَهُمۡ كَعَصۡفٖ مَّأۡكُولِۭ",
      "translation": "And He made them like eaten straw.[1994]",
      "footnotes": "[1994] i.e., husks which have been chewed by cattle. This event took place in the year of the Prophet's birth."
    }
  ],
